WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.384 --> 00:00:03.573
查看快捷操作的历史请求 / Inspect the captured shortcut source

2
00:00:03.573 --> 00:00:07.098
打开Breakpoint作用范围菜单 / Open the Breakpoint scope menu

3
00:00:07.098 --> 00:00:07.873
选择Endpoint并立即Apply / Choose Endpoint and apply immediately

4
00:00:07.873 --> 00:00:11.197
使用创建提示中的Undo / Use Undo in the creation notice

5
00:00:11.197 --> 00:00:14.204
发送新请求确认已撤销 / Send a new request to verify undo

6
00:00:14.204 --> 00:00:17.647
再次打开同一Endpoint菜单 / Reopen the same Endpoint menu

7
00:00:17.647 --> 00:00:20.701
重新创建本轮断点 / Recreate this example Breakpoint

8
00:00:20.701 --> 00:00:23.751
打开断点管理器 / Open the Breakpoint manager

9
00:00:23.751 --> 00:00:26.753
关闭全局Break on match / Turn off global Break on match

10
00:00:26.753 --> 00:00:30.102
关闭管理器 / Close the manager

11
00:00:30.102 --> 00:00:33.097
确认全局关闭时不暂停新请求 / Verify new requests do not pause while globally disabled

12
00:00:33.097 --> 00:00:36.097
再次打开管理器 / Open the manager again

13
00:00:36.097 --> 00:00:39.154
重新开启Break on match / Enable Break on match again

14
00:00:39.154 --> 00:00:42.451
回到请求列表 / Return to the request list

15
00:00:42.451 --> 00:00:45.396
发送会由客户端取消的请求 / Send a request that the client will cancel

16
00:00:45.396 --> 00:00:48.397
查看这个Head等待项 / Inspect this Head item

17
00:00:48.397 --> 00:00:51.394
客户端结束后等待项自动解除 / Let the client abort and release the pending item

18
00:00:51.394 --> 00:00:54.496
重新发送得到新的等待项 / Send again to obtain a new pending item

19
00:00:54.496 --> 00:00:57.783
原样放行请求阶段 / Continue the request phase unchanged

20
00:00:57.783 --> 00:01:00.987
原样放行响应阶段 / Continue the response phase unchanged

21
00:01:00.987 --> 00:01:03.953
打开管理器停用单条规则 / Open the manager to disable one Rule

22
00:01:03.953 --> 00:01:06.945
只停用本轮Endpoint规则 / Disable only this Endpoint Rule

23
00:01:06.945 --> 00:01:10.212
返回列表检查停用结果 / Return to the list to inspect disabling

24
00:01:10.212 --> 00:01:13.147
新请求不再被该规则挂起 / Verify the disabled Rule no longer pauses new requests

25
00:01:13.147 --> 00:01:16.539
从管理器进入对应Rules / Open the corresponding Rule from the manager
